  Sensible (aka Lazydeb) — Debian Testing Live Installer

  To start the installer, run:
    sensible-install   (or: lazydeb)      [asks for sudo automatically]

  Sensible installs a UEFI-only system; a BIOS-booted session is refused.

  For network configuration:
    nmtui   (or: nmcli device wifi connect <SSID> password <PASS>)

